# Hook sites in the `main` module of Hyrule Warriors: Age of Calamity, passed to the lifter with --sites. Generated by NX/addrs.py from recomp/addrs.tsv: edit that.
# Addresses are guest addresses: main base 0x7100000000 + the offset in the binary.
entryhook 0x710166fff0   # KIDS frame task (once per update, before the scene): Info::frame_update, the base's frame boundary
midhook 0x7101670230   # KIDS frame task: udiv x26,x24,x20 (period = tick frequency / fps): x20 = huge, the game's own 1/fps wait does not hold
midhook 0x71016702b0   # KIDS frame task, after the wait (every path): per-update ticks, the frame-rate block and the device frame rate
midhook 0x71016702dc   # KIDS frame task: w8 / s0 = the frame-rate object's two steps (x23 = the object, +0x48 its fps), [x19,#0x18] stored
midhook 0x7101670414   # KIDS frame task, no frame-rate object: s0 / w8 = 1 / fps or the measured time, [x19,#0x18] stored
midhook 0x7100857d80   # scene update: after add w10,w10,#1 (an event cutscene's frame, 30 fps frames)
midhook 0x7100857da4   # scene update: after sub w10,w10,#1 (the event cutscene's frames left)
midhook 0x7100b09ad4   # after ucvtf s1,s1 of the block's fps (+8): s1 = 1 / step
